🚀 Step 37: I/O Systems, Interrupts & Device Management

This is the chapter where the OS communicates with real hardware.

Until now we learned:

CPU
Processes
Memory
Files
Disks

But a computer also has:

🖱 Mouse
⌨ Keyboard
🖨 Printer
🎤 Microphone
📷 Webcam
